<p>Imbibe a potent mixture of energizing and restorative substances, restoring <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">220, 273, 319, 361, 400</acronym> life, <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">54, 68, 79, 90, 99</acronym> stamina and curing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 2, 2, 3</acronym> detrimental physical effects.  The restorative effects improve with your Cunning.</p><p><span style="color: #ffff00"><span class="tstr-color-YELLOW">Prepared with: not prepared</span></span></p>